---
import MainLayout from "../../../layouts/MainLayout.astro";

export const meta = {
  title: "Image Compressor Online",
  description: "Kompres gambar JPG, PNG, WebP dengan cepat dan gratis. Kurangi ukuran hingga 90% tanpa kehilangan kualitas. 100% Client Side & Privasi Aman.",
  category: "Image",
  featured: true
};
---

<MainLayout title={`${meta.title} | AI Mr Ferdy`} description={meta.description} pageCSS={["tools"]}>

<div>
  <div class="compressor-app">
    <!-- LEFT PANEL -->
    <div class="comp-panel">
      <div class="comp-title">Upload Gambar</div>
      
      <div class="upload-area" id="uploadArea">
        <input type="file" id="imageInput" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" hidden>
        <div class="upload-content">
          <span class="upload-icon">📁</span>
          <p>Klik atau drop gambar di sini</p>
          <small>JPG • PNG • WebP • Maksimal 10MB</small>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="settings" class="settings hidden">
        <label>Kualitas Kompresi: <span id="qualityValue">80</span>%</label>
        <input type="range" id="quality" min="10" max="100" value="80" class="quality-slider">

        <label>Format Output</label>
        <select id="format">
          <option value="image/jpeg">JPEG (.jpg)</option>
          <option value="image/webp" selected>WebP (.webp) - Paling Ringan</option>
          <option value="image/png">PNG (.png)</option>
        </select>

        <label>Lebar Maksimal (px)</label>
        <input type="number" id="maxWidth" value="1920" placeholder="1920">

        <button class="btn-primary" onclick="compressImage()">🔄 Kompres Gambar</button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- RIGHT PANEL -->
    <div class="comp-panel">
      <div class="comp-title">Preview</div>
      
      <div class="preview-container">
        <!-- Original -->
        <div class="preview-box">
          <p class="preview-label">Original</p>
          <div class="image-wrapper" id="originalWrapper">
            <img id="originalImg" alt="Original Image" style="display:none;">
            <div class="placeholder" id="originalPlaceholder">
              <span class="upload-icon">📸</span>
              <p>Belum ada gambar</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <small id="originalSize"></small>
        </div>

        <!-- Compressed -->
        <div class="preview-box">
          <p class="preview-label">Hasil Kompresi</p>
          <div class="image-wrapper" id="compressedWrapper">
            <img id="compressedImg" alt="Compressed Image" style="display:none;">
            <div class="placeholder" id="compressedPlaceholder">
              <span class="upload-icon">📦</span>
              <p>Menunggu kompresi...</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <small id="compressedSize"></small>
          <div id="reduction" class="reduction hidden"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div id="downloadSection" class="download-section hidden">
        <button onclick="downloadCompressed()" class="btn-primary">
          ⬇️ Download Gambar Kompresi
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="tool-hero">
  <h1>Image Compressor Online Gratis</h1>
  <p>Kompres gambar JPG, PNG, dan WebP dengan cepat. Kurangi ukuran file hingga 90% tanpa kehilangan kualitas yang berarti.</p>
</section>

<!-- SEO CONTENT -->
<section class="tool-seo">
  <h2>Apa Itu Image Compressor Online?</h2>
  <p>
    Image Compressor Online adalah alat gratis yang membantu mengurangi ukuran file gambar tanpa mengurangi kualitas secara signifikan. 
    Semua proses dilakukan langsung di browser Anda (client-side), sehingga privasi gambar terjaga 100%.
  </p>

  <h2>Kenapa Harus Mengompres Gambar?</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Mempercepat loading website dan meningkatkan SEO</li>
    <li>Menghemat kuota internet dan ruang penyimpanan</li>
    <li>Memudahkan upload ke Instagram, WhatsApp, Tokopedia, Shopee, dll</li>
    <li>Meningkatkan performa blog dan landing page</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<!-- COLLAPSE CONTENT + FAQ -->
<section class="tool-more">
  <details>
    <summary>Cara Menggunakan Image Compressor</summary>
    <ol>
      <li>Klik area upload atau drag & drop foto/gambar Anda</li>
      <li>Atur kualitas kompresi (rekomendasi 75-85%)</li>
      <li>Pilih format output (WebP paling ringan)</li>
      <li>Klik tombol <strong>Kompres Gambar</strong></li>
      <li>Download hasil kompresi</li>
    </ol>
  </details>

  <details>
    <summary>Fitur Unggulan</summary>
    <ul>
      <li>Kompresi hingga <strong>90% lebih kecil</strong></li>
      <li>Support JPG, PNG, WebP</li>
      <li>Resize otomatis + custom max width</li>
      <li>Preview Before & After</li>
      <li>100% Client Side (privasi aman)</li>
      <li>Gratis tanpa batas & tanpa watermark</li>
    </ul>
  </details>

  <details>
    <summary>Tips Mengompres Gambar Optimal</summary>
    <ul>
      <li>Gunakan <strong>WebP</strong> untuk hasil paling ringan</li>
      <li>Kualitas 75-85% sudah sangat baik untuk kebanyakan keperluan</li>
      <li>Untuk logo/gambar teks, gunakan kualitas lebih tinggi</li>
      <li>Kompres sebelum upload ke website atau media sosial</li>
    </ul>
  </details>

  <details>
    <summary>Pertanyaan yang Sering Ditanyakan (FAQ)</summary>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <h4>Apakah tool ini gratis?</h4>
      <p>Ya, 100% gratis, tanpa login, tanpa batas, dan tanpa watermark.</p>

      <h4>Apakah gambar saya aman?</h4>
      <p>Sangat aman. Semua proses kompresi dilakukan di perangkat Anda sendiri, tidak ada data yang diupload ke server.</p>

      <h4>Format mana yang paling bagus?</h4>
      <p><strong>WebP</strong> adalah yang terbaik untuk ukuran kecil dengan kualitas tinggi.</p>

      <h4>Berapa persen ukuran bisa dikurangi?</h4>
      <p>Biasanya 60% - 90%, tergantung pengaturan dan jenis gambar.</p>

      <h4>Apakah kualitas gambar turun drastis?</h4>
      <p>Tidak, jika kualitas di atas 70%. Perbedaannya hampir tidak terlihat.</p>
    </div>
  </details>
</section>

<!-- FAQ SCHEMA -->
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Apakah Image Compressor ini gratis?",
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Ya, sepenuhnya gratis tanpa batas dan tanpa pendaftaran." }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Apakah gambar saya aman?",
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "Ya, 100% aman karena proses dilakukan di browser Anda sendiri." }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Format mana yang paling direkomendasikan?",
      "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": "WebP adalah format terbaik untuk ukuran kecil dengan kualitas tinggi." }
    }
  ]
}
</script>

<script client:load>
let originalFile = null;
let compressedDataUrl = null;
let originalSize = 0;

const uploadArea = document.getElementById('uploadArea');
const imageInput = document.getElementById('imageInput');
const settings = document.getElementById('settings');
const qualitySlider = document.getElementById('quality');
const qualityValue = document.getElementById('qualityValue');

qualitySlider.addEventListener('input', () => {
  qualityValue.textContent = qualitySlider.value;
});

// Upload
uploadArea.addEventListener('click', () => imageInput.click());
imageInput.addEventListener('change', e => e.target.files[0] && handleFile(e.target.files[0]));

uploadArea.addEventListener('dragover', e => { e.preventDefault(); uploadArea.style.borderColor = 'var(--accent)'; });
uploadArea.addEventListener('dragleave', () => uploadArea.style.borderColor = 'var(--border)');
uploadArea.addEventListener('drop', e => {
  e.preventDefault();
  uploadArea.style.borderColor = 'var(--border)';
  if (e.dataTransfer.files.length) handleFile(e.dataTransfer.files[0]);
});

function handleFile(file) {
  if (!file.type.startsWith('image/')) {
    alert('Mohon upload file gambar (JPG, PNG, WebP)');
    return;
  }

  originalFile = file;
  originalSize = file.size;

  const reader = new FileReader();
  reader.onload = function(e) {
    document.getElementById('originalImg').src = e.target.result;
    document.getElementById('originalImg').style.display = 'block';
    document.getElementById('originalPlaceholder').style.display = 'none';

    document.getElementById('originalSize').textContent = `Ukuran: ${(file.size / (1024 * 1024)).toFixed(2)} MB`;

    settings.classList.remove('hidden');
    document.getElementById('downloadSection').classList.add('hidden');
    document.getElementById('compressedImg').style.display = 'none';
    document.getElementById('compressedPlaceholder').style.display = 'flex';
  };
  reader.readAsDataURL(file);
}

window.compressImage = function() {
  if (!originalFile) return;

  const canvas = document.createElement('canvas');
  const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
  const img = new Image();

  img.onload = function() {
    let { width, height } = img;
    const maxWidth = parseInt(document.getElementById('maxWidth').value) || 1920;

    if (width > maxWidth) {
      height = Math.round((height * maxWidth) / width);
      width = maxWidth;
    }

    canvas.width = width;
    canvas.height = height;
    ctx.drawImage(img, 0, 0, width, height);

    const format = document.getElementById('format').value;
    const quality = parseInt(qualitySlider.value) / 100;

    compressedDataUrl = canvas.toDataURL(format, quality);

    document.getElementById('compressedImg').src = compressedDataUrl;
    document.getElementById('compressedImg').style.display = 'block';
    document.getElementById('compressedPlaceholder').style.display = 'none';

    const compressedSizeKB = Math.round((compressedDataUrl.length * 0.75) / 1024);
    const reduction = Math.round(((originalSize / 1024) - compressedSizeKB) / (originalSize / 1024) * 100);

    document.getElementById('compressedSize').innerHTML = `
      Ukuran: ${compressedSizeKB} KB 
      <span style="color:var(--success)">(-${reduction}%)</span>
    `;

    document.getElementById('reduction').classList.remove('hidden');
    document.getElementById('downloadSection').classList.remove('hidden');
  };

  img.src = URL.createObjectURL(originalFile);
};

window.downloadCompressed = function() {
  if (!compressedDataUrl) return;
  const link = document.createElement('a');
  const ext = document.getElementById('format').value === 'image/webp' ? 'webp' : 
              document.getElementById('format').value === 'image/png' ? 'png' : 'jpg';
  link.download = `compressed-image.${ext}`;
  link.href = compressedDataUrl;
  link.click();
};
</script>

<style is:global>
.compressor-app { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 30px; }
@media (max-width: 768px) { .compressor-app { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

.comp-panel {
  background: var(--card);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  padding: 24px;
  border-radius: 16px;
}

.comp-title { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 16px; }

.upload-area {
  border: 2px dashed var(--border);
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 60px 20px;
  text-align: center;
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: 0.3s;
}
.upload-area:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }

.settings { margin-top: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }
.quality-slider { width: 100%; accent-color: var(--accent); }

.preview-container { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; }
@media (max-width: 640px) { .preview-container { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

.image-wrapper {
  position: relative;
  background: #f8fafc;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: 12px;
  min-height: 240px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  overflow: hidden;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.image-wrapper img {
  max-width: 100%;
  max-height: 280px;
  height: auto;
  object-fit: contain;
  border-radius: 8px;
}

.placeholder { text-align: center; color: var(--muted); }
.placeholder .upload-icon { font-size: 42px; margin-bottom: 8px; opacity: 0.6; }

.preview-label { font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--text); }

.reduction {
  margin-top: 8px;
  padding: 8px 12px;
  background: #d1fae5;
  color: #10b981;
  border-radius: 8px;
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.btn-primary {
  width: 100%;
  padding: 14px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  border: none;
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0ea5e9, #2563eb);
  color: white;
  font-weight: 600;
  cursor: pointer;
  font-size: 16px;
}

.faq-list h4 { margin: 16px 0 6px; font-size: 15px; }
.faq-list p { margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--text-soft); }
</style>

</MainLayout>
